[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0867","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0867.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0712","title":"LIDS Linux 入侵检测系统 权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 入侵检测系统 (LIDS) 0.9.7 版本存在权限提升漏洞，当系统通过 security=0 启动参数禁用 LIDS 保护机制时，本地用户可利用该配置缺陷将权限提升至 root。该漏洞属于本地权限提升类型，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限且无需身份认证，即可通过修改内核启动参数绕过 LIDS 安全防护，完全破坏系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。受影响版本为 LIDS 0.9.7，CVSS 评分 7.2（高危），攻击向量为本地、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、影响完全。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0712"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:19Z","remediation":"立即升级到LIDS 1.0以上版本，并重新启用LIDS安全机制。升级时请确保彻底删除旧的security=0启动参数，重新构建并启动全新内核引导系统。如果无法立即升级，建议禁用Anonymous Unix socket权限并应用最新的安全补丁包（如漏洞公开时的LIDS安全修复版），同时确保系统中未存在任何配置将其强制禁用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0486.html","http://www.egroups.com/message/lids/1038","http://www.lids.org/changelog.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1495","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1549","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0712.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0712.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0712","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0712.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0712.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2000/CVE-2000-0712.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0712.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/094d6382e9f2b76e665247588266e58be890fb67/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0712.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e3642