1:52:17Z","remediation":"删除 pgxconfig 的 setuid 位：`chmod u-s /usr/bin/pgxconfig`，或限制仅授权用户可执行：`chmod 750 /usr/bin/pgxconfig`。如厂商已发布补丁，升级 Raptor GFX 到最新版本。作为临时缓解，移除该工具的 SUID 权限可阻断提权路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0463.html","http://www.osvdb.org/5740","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0694.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0694.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0694","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0694.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0694.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0694.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9b61e147dd97f8b10bc28655d49bf9e6a89e79e2/2000/CVE-2000-0694.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0694.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0694.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0694.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0859.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0858","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0858.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0693","title":"Tech-Source Raptor GFX PGX32 配置工具本地任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Raptor GFX 配置工具中的 pgxconfig 程序在调用系统命令时使用了相对路径来执行 \"cp\" 程序，而非绝对路径。本地攻击者可通过修改 PATH 环境变量，将恶意程序命名为 \"cp\" 并置于优先搜索路径中，当 pgxconfig 执行时即可触发任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Tech-Source Raptor GFX PGX32 2.3.1 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0693"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:16Z","remediation":"升级 Raptor GFX PGX32 至 2.3.2 及以上版本，该版本已将 pgxconfig 中对 cp 的调用改为绝对路径 /bin/cp。如无法升级，可手动修改 pgxconfig 脚本，将所有系统命令调用改为绝对路径，并确保 PATH 环境变量中不含不可信目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0463.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1501","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1563","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0693.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0693.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0693","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0693.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0693.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0693.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9b61e147dd97f8b10bc28655d49bf9e6a89e79e2/2000/CVE-2000-0693.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0693.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0693.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0693.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0858.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0857","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0857.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0692","title":"ISS RealSecure 分片SYN报文洪泛拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ISS RealSecure 3.2.1 及 3.2.2 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送大量设置了 SYN 标志的分片数据包，导致系统资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞利用方式简单，无需身份认证，攻击者仅需构造特制的 SYN 分片洪水包即可触发，影响运行上述版本 ISS RealSecure 的服务器系统。目前官方已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0692"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:16Z","remediation":"升级 ISS RealSecure 至 3.2.3 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可在网络边界防火墙或路由器上配置访问控制规则，丢弃异常 SYN 分片包，并限制单位时间内新建连接数以缓解 DoS 攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0267.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1597","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0692.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0692.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0692","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0692.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0692.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0692.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9b61e147dd97f8b10bc28655d49bf9e6a89e79e2/2000/CVE-2000-0692.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0692.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/e7393e4662b98c582439177871aa2228c548d9c4/tracker/CVE/2000/CVE-2000-0692.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0692.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0857.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0854","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0854.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0686","title":"Auction Weaver CGI 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Auction Weaver CGI 脚本 1.03 及更早版本中存在路径遍历漏洞，攻击者可通过向 fromfile 参数提交包含 `..`（点点）序列的恶意请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击条件低，可导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、密码文件等），危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0686"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:16Z","remediation":"立即升级 Auction Weaver CGI 脚本至 1.04 或更高版本。由于该产品已停止维护多年，建议彻底移除或禁用 Auction Weaver CGI 脚本，改用受支持的替代方案。如必须继续使用，应在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache mod_rewrite）对 fromfile 参数进行过滤，拒绝包含 ../ 或 %2e%2e/ 等路径遍历特征的请求，同时限制 Web 进程对敏感系统文件的读取权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0310.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1630","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0686.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0686.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0686","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0686.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0686.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0686.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c376806cb2dc05fbeb559b5b1364bc1c095ae81e/2000/CVE-2000-0686.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0686.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-