ct/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0682.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0682","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0682.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0682.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08990b84a65d14f7de760be267bdf98ec816883a/2000/CVE-2000-0682.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/57b318ad84d91f19df2f11e62567e45db1dd90ad/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0682.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0682.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0682.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0682.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0682.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0841.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0841.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0841.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0835","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0835.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0678","title":"PGP 5.5.x-6.5.3 附加解密密钥(ADK)证书验证漏洞","description":"PGP 5.5.x 至 6.5.3 版本存在附加解密密钥（ADK）验证缺陷，攻击者可在修改受害者公钥证书后，将恶意 ADK 嵌入证书的签名部分，由于 PGP 未正确验证 ADK 是否位于证书的签名区域内，导致攻击者能够解密所有使用该被篡改证书加密的数据。该漏洞影响 PGP 全系列加密通信软件，攻击者需具备中间人篡改证书的能力，利用条件相对有限但危害严重，可导致加密通信内容完全泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0678"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:15Z","remediation":"立即升级 PGP 至 6.5.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ADK 密钥未在证书签名部分校验的问题。如无法升级，应在接收他人公钥时严格验证证书完整性，仅从可信密钥服务器（如 PGP Global Directory）获取公钥，并手动检查证书中是否包含未经授权的 ADK 子密钥。企业用户可部署 S/MIME 替代方案作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-18.html","http://www.osvdb.org/4354","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1606","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2000/CVE-2000-0678.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0678.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-0678.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-0678.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0678.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0678","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0678.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0678.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0678.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/91ab7783643591e4c1949aca858fc331aabcb87c/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-0678.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0835.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0601","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0601.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0799","title":"SGI IRIX InPerson inpview 竞态条件漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 操作系统 5.3 至 6.5.10 版本的 InPerson 组件中 inpview 程序存在竞争条件与符号链接攻击漏洞。该程序在运行过程中创建名为 .ilmpAAA 的临时文件时，未对文件名冲突及符号链接攻击进行有效防护，攻击者可利用可预测的临时文件名提前创建指向敏感系统文件的符号链接，在 inpview 以高权限执行并写入该文件时触发竞争条件，从而将符号链接指向的文件内容覆盖或篡改，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 5.3 至 6.5.10 版本，仅需本地系统访问权限即可利用，无需额外身份认证，但由于需要把握临时文件创建的精确时机，攻击复杂度较高。成功利用后可导致攻击者获取系统更高权限，进而对系统机密性、完整性和可用性造成部分影响。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0799"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:30Z","remediation":"升级 SGI IRIX 至 6.5.11 或更高版本以修复 inpview 符号链接竞争条件漏洞（SGI 安全公告 2000-11-01-I）。如无法立即升级，可将 /usr/lib/InPerson/inpview 的 SUID 位移除（chmod u-s /usr/lib/InPerson/inpview）或直接删除该文件以阻止利用，同时对 /var/tmp 目录设置粘滞位（chmod 1777 /var/tmp），防止普通用户创建指向敏感文件的符号链接，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1530","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200008021924.e72JOVs12558%40ix.put.poznan.pl","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5065","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20130","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/285830d3bc68381daeff2169c3b0a4500df03b19/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0799.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0799","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dd1c73c7d44a762cc5a69d15ad07fe20976d7aec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0799.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0799.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d31055ab38952b633bc0cc17d118adcd7947f0ed/2000/CVE-2000-0799.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0799.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0799.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0799.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0799.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0799.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0601.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0601.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0601.toml"}]